 "notes": [
  "Lane large-buildings-20261120 (2026-11-20), backlog row 11. Groups: 0 the five-storey E range (w02-73L, 2024-12-03); 1 the nine-storey grid above and behind it (same crop); 2 the E tower front (w04-73, 2025-01-09); 3 and 4 the N fronts (w05-343, 2017-07-06); 5 the dark-brick NE end wall with sparse small windows over a glazed/open ground floor (w03-67, 2024-12-03).",
  "Colours INFERRED, not measured: the crops are graded green-grey and tree-covered, so concrete #8a8b86 and the end wall's dark brick #3a3634 are read by eye. The W (courtyard) front has no photograph and stays in the window grid.",
  "Not modelled: the recessed balcony cells in the concrete frame, the open arcade under the NE end wall (drawn glazed)."
